  "description": "ONE GR FULL CARBON INTEGRATED The OИE GR full carbon integrated handlebar is designed for the Gravel Racing world. Designed for total cable integration, it improves performance in terms of stiffness and aerodynamics and ensures high comfort thanks to the opening optimized for rough terrain. Technical info WEIGHT 390 grams FLARE 12° MEASURES 38x80, 40x90, 42x100, 44x110\n\nDiscover the new ITM wheels Find out more about the ITM wheels developed exclusively for Bottecchia. FIND OUT MORE\n\nRACING TECHNOLOGIES DEPARTMENT Full carbon frame weighing 1,100 kg with improved rear triangle tube section for greater riding stability on uneven surfaces. The sloping geometry is slightly elongated for a racing-comfort riding setting, with lowered steering and slightly slacker angles. Aerodynamics are significantly improved thanks to the dedicated carbon aero seatpost, integrated clamp and new ONE GR full carbon integrated handlebar. 50mm wheel clearance specifically designed to improve aerodynamics and avoid blocking in muddy terrain. Provisions to accommodate bottle cages and frame bags on both the frame and fork for a complete bikepacking set up. IDEAL FOR Designed for 360° gravel, OVERLAND ensures excellent performance on dirt roads and single tracks but also responds perfectly to the needs of explorers and adventurers who travel long distances on mixed terrain in bike packing. PERFECT FOR YOU IF If you are looking for the perfect gravel: light, reactive, easy to handle, adaptable to the multiple uses required of a gravel bike. Designed for those who want to experience adventure without sacrificing performance, because even travel can be adrenaline and speed.\n\nWhat's your size? Check out our SIZE GUIDE for an indication of the frame size that is best for you. Remember that a biomechanical evaluation with your local authorized dealer is always recommended.",
